I grew up watching The Simpsons, so it always makes me smile to get to actually see the voice
尤其是丹·卡斯泰拉内塔，总是让我感到开心。

138
00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:31.770
actors in another show, especially Dan Castellaneta.
嗯，伙计们，如果你们不知道的话，丹就是荷马·辛普森的配音演员。

139
