00:06:56.050 --> 00:07:02.010
of it, but he said Dan is, quote, literally one of the funniest people in TV history, and
只是没人知道，因为他是个卡通人物。

144
00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:03.810
nobody knows it because he's a cartoon.
所以我非常兴奋能让他出镜，因为他在真人表演中也是一位非常出色的演员。

145
00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:10.090
So I was incredibly excited to get him on camera because he's a really good actor in live action
他表现得太棒了。

146
00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:10.830
as well.
我想格雷格对此也一定非常兴奋，因为格雷格曾写过几集《辛普森一家》的剧本。

147
00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:12.450
He was fantastic.
是的。

148
00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:17.530
I imagine Greg was really excited about this as well, since Greg had written some Simpsons
是的。

149
00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:18.170
episodes.
是的。

150
00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:18.950
Yeah.
是的。

